      "zh": "# ♈ 白羊座上升星座\n\n## 含义\n\n你的上升星座在白羊座，定义了How you appear to others, your mask, first impressions。这是星盘中理解outer presentation and approach to life最重要的配置之一。\n\n## 核心特质\n\n上升星座在白羊座，你以热情和勇气的方式处理outer presentation and approach to life。\n\n## 表现\n\n- **最佳状态：** 大胆、鼓舞人心、天生领袖\n- **阴影面：** 冲动、没耐心、容易 burnout\n\n## 感情关系\n\n这个配置显著影响你与他人的关系方式。理解你的上升星座能帮你认清自己的模式和需求。\n\n## 获取完整星盘\n\n你的上升星座只是一层。完整的出生星盘——太阳、月亮、上升、所有行星、宫位和相位——才讲述完整故事。\n\n[免费排盘 →](/natal)\n\n[解锁个性化年运报告 · $19.99](https://hanhan55.gumroad.com/l/zxccdv)",
      "en": "# ♈ Aries Rising Sign (Ascendant)\n\n## What It Means\n\nYour rising sign (ascendant) in Aries defines how you appear to others, your mask, first impressions. This is one of the most important placements in your chart for understanding outer presentation and approach to life.\n\n## Key Traits\n\nWith Rising Sign (Ascendant) in Aries, you approach outer presentation and approach to life with enthusiasm and courage.\n\n## How It Shows Up\n\n- **At your best:** Bold, inspiring, a natural leader\n- **Shadow side:** Impulsive, impatient, burns out\n\n## In Relationships\n\nThis placement significantly impacts how you relate to others. Understanding your rising sign (ascendant) helps you recognize your patterns and needs.\n\n## Get Your Full Chart\n\nYour Rising Sign (Ascendant) is just one layer. Your complete natal chart — Sun, Moon, Rising, all planets, houses, and aspects — tells the full story.\n\n[Calculate your free chart →](/natal)\n\n[Unlock your personalized Annual Report · $19.99](https://hanhan55.gumroad.com/l/zxccdv)",
