      "zh": "# ♈ 白羊座火星星座\n\n## 含义\n\n你的火星星座在白羊座，定义了How you take action, your desires, energy and drive。这是星盘中理解action style and passion最重要的配置之一。\n\n## 核心特质\n\n火星星座在白羊座，你以热情和勇气的方式处理action style and passion。\n\n## 表现\n\n- **最佳状态：** 大胆、鼓舞人心、天生领袖\n- **阴影面：** 冲动、没耐心、容易 burnout\n\n## 感情关系\n\n这个配置显著影响你与他人的关系方式。理解你的火星星座能帮你认清自己的模式和需求。\n\n## 获取完整星盘\n\n你的火星星座只是一层。完整的出生星盘——太阳、月亮、上升、所有行星、宫位和相位——才讲述完整故事。\n\n[免费排盘 →](/natal)\n\n[解锁个性化年运报告 · $19.99](https://hanhan55.gumroad.com/l/zxccdv)",
      "en": "# ♈ Aries Mars Sign\n\n## What It Means\n\nYour mars sign in Aries defines how you take action, your desires, energy and drive. This is one of the most important placements in your chart for understanding action style and passion.\n\n## Key Traits\n\nWith Mars Sign in Aries, you approach action style and passion with enthusiasm and courage.\n\n## How It Shows Up\n\n- **At your best:** Bold, inspiring, a natural leader\n- **Shadow side:** Impulsive, impatient, burns out\n\n## In Relationships\n\nThis placement significantly impacts how you relate to others. Understanding your mars sign helps you recognize your patterns and needs.\n\n## Get Your Full Chart\n\nYour Mars Sign is just one layer. Your complete natal chart — Sun, Moon, Rising, all planets, houses, and aspects — tells the full story.\n\n[Calculate your free chart →](/natal)\n\n[Unlock your personalized Annual Report · $19.99](https://hanhan55.gumroad.com/l/zxccdv)",
